           "t": "html",
           "items": [
            {
             "t": "h3",
             "html": "Problem"
            },
            {
             "t": "h1",
             "html": "Users struggled to understand EchoKids’ values and their offerings"
            },
            {
             "t": "p",
             "html": "User feedback indicated that clients found it difficult to understand EchoKids’ values based on the way information was offered and lack of specific information as well as difficulty finding certain information about the company. Parts of the website also proved to be overly text-heavy, discouraging users from further learning about the company."
            }
           ]
