       "t": "html",
       "items": [
        {
         "t": "p",
         "html": "The old flow involved several steps to find information about the company, with an emphasis on exploring memberships before learning about the company itself. There was also a notable absence of a dedicated section that explained the company's core values. What if we improved the accessibility of important information about the company?"
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "t": "col",
     "span": 1,
     "kids": []
    }
   ]
