             "t": "h1",
             "html": "Mapping out the journeys of indirect competitors"
            },
            {
             "t": "p",
             "html": "To assess the strengths and weaknesses of the EchoKids website, I conducted research on indirect competitors, focusing on B-Corporations that offer educational platforms. This strategic approach aligns with the CEO's vision of reflecting B-Corporation values in her own company. My analysis included in-depth examinations of Moodle and Coursera, where I closely evaluated how their navigation systems influence the overall user experience."
            }
           ]
          }
